"MAP_SHARED mappings of a file opened read-only are transformed into "
"VMA_MAYSHARE_BIT, !VMA_SHARED_BIT, !VMA_MAYWRITE_BIT mappings, so remain non-"
"CoW."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:107: ../include/linux/mm.h:2304
msgid ""
"Drivers may clear VMA_MAYWRITE_BIT but do so at mmap() time and cannot mark "
"themselves anonymous. Having cleared this flag it is not valid for them to "
"leave the VMA_WRITE_BIT flag set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:107: ../include/linux/mm.h:2308
msgid ""
"As a consequence, the anonymous reverse mapping only tracks CoW mappings."
msgstr ""

