"Otherwise, it is treated the same way as folio_add_lru()."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:121: ../mm/folio.c:657
msgid "Deactivate a file folio."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:121: ../mm/folio.c:658
msgid "Folio to deactivate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:121: ../mm/folio.c:659
msgid ""
"This function hints to the VM that **folio** is a good reclaim candidate, "
"for example if its invalidation fails due to the folio being dirty or under "
"writeback."
msgstr ""

