"folio_mark_lazyfree() moves **folio** to the inactive file list. This is "
"done to accelerate the reclaim of **folio**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core-api/mm-api:121: ../mm/folio.c:885
msgid "drain LRU caches if the caches might hold folio references"
msgstr ""

