"snapshot a monotonically-incremented counter and subtract two samples: "
"unsigned modular arithmetic then yields the correct delta across a signed-"
"long wraparound (a real hazard on 32-bit) that the clamp would otherwise "
"turn into a huge spurious delta."
msgstr ""

